{"uid":"f3275d202a5174b7","name":"test_nonexistent_user_also_returns_403","fullName":"test_cases.admin.test_admin_authz#test_nonexistent_user_also_returns_403","time":{"start":1793386815120,"stop":1793386815131,"duration":11},"description":"普通用户改一个**不存在**的 userId → 也应该 403，不是 404。\n\n    ══ 为什么这算安全问题 ══\n    如果先查用户是否存在、再查权限，那么：\n        存在的 id   → 403\n        不存在的 id → 404\n    攻击者不用登录就能把 id 从 1 试到 100 万，画出一张\"哪些用户 id 存在\"的地图\n    （业界叫用户枚举 / user enumeration）。正确顺序是**先鉴权、再查资源**。\n\n    实测当前后端是对的（全返 403），所以这条是**回归保护**：\n    哪天有人在 Controller 里把 userService.findById 挪到 requireAdmin 前面，\n    这条会红，而且报错会明确指出\"泄露了存在性\"。\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>普通用户改一个<strong>不存在</strong>的 userId → 也应该 403，不是 404。</p>\n<pre><code>══ 为什么这算安全问题 ══\n如果先查用户是否存在、再查权限，那么：\n    存在的 id   → 403\n    不存在的 id → 404\n攻击者不用登录就能把 id 从 1 试到 100 万，画出一张&quot;哪些用户 id 存在&quot;的地图\n（业界叫用户枚举 / user enumeration）。正确顺序是**先鉴权、再查资源**。\n\n实测当前后端是对的（全返 403），所以这条是**回归保护**：\n哪天有人在 Controller 里把 userService.findById 挪到 requireAdmin 前面，\n这条会红，而且报错会明确指出&quot;泄露了存在性&quot;。\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"api","time":{"start":1793386814707,"stop":1793386814707,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"hasContent":false,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_cleanup_guard","time":{"start":1793386814707,"stop":1793386814707,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"hasContent":false,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_auth_state","time":{"start":1793386814708,"stop":1793386814783,"duration":75},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[{"uid":"94eb81088845620c","name":"→ 请求　POST /auth/login","source":"94eb81088845620c.txt","type":"text/plain","size":297},{"uid":"be4d9696251224ef","name":"← 响